05. POST with bad snapshotLifetime — expect 400
===============================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 206

{
  "detail": "'snapshotLifetime' must be a positive ISO 8601 duration (e.g. \"PT1H\", \"P1D\")",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Bad Request",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



